  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><span><span>With the general availability of the </span><span>postgresql-hll</span><span>&nbsp;extension </span><span>in Azure Database for PostgreSQL, </span><span>you </span><span>can </span><span>efficiently approximate unique elements using</span><span>&nbsp;the</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>HyperLogLog</span><span>&nbsp;data structure, which is ideal for large-scale analytics. </span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></div><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/postgresql/extensions/concepts-extensions-versions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div>",
    "Markdown": "With the general availability of the postgresql-hll extension in Azure Database for PostgreSQL, you can efficiently approximate unique elements using the HyperLogLog data structure, which is ideal for large-scale analytics.\n\nLearn more ."
  },
